{
    "title": "Shortboxed",
    "description": "What is Shortboxed?\r\n\r\nShortboxed is the most trusted marketplace and auction platform to buy and sell comic books. In addition to a thriving community with tens of thousands of buyers and sellers, there are also free tools and resources such as a price guide, portfolio manager, extensive data, and quality content to make buying and selling easy, safe, and fun.\r\n\r\nHow does buying and selling work?\r\n\r\nFor the marketplace, vetted dealers, comic shop owners, and collectors list their comic books for sale on Shortboxed while buyers browse and discover tens of thousands of comic books, both graded and ungraded. When someone buys a book, the seller receives an order confirmation with a pre-paid shipping label. Sellers get paid once the book is confirmed delivered. Our seller fee is a flat 10% - no hidden fees or shenanigans. Super simple!\r\n\r\nFor event style auctions, approved sellers send in their books to Shortboxed before an auction is curated. Once the auction event is live, buyers can bid on items until the closing time. Once an auction event ends, winners will receive an invoice to pay before receiving their items.\r\n\r\nShortboxed Features\r\n\r\nSell raw or graded comic books - you can submit raw or graded comic books for sale on Shortboxed, with all raw books verified by Shortboxed before being delivered to the buyer. Buy and sell with confidence!\r\n\r\nQuick and easy submissions - take a couple pics, add a price and any additional info as needed, and that\u2019s it. We take care of the rest, including exposure to tens of thousands of potential buyers across the U.S., Canada and U.K.  \r\n\r\nWe handle customer support - have an issue with an order? Our attentive team will take care of any questions or order issues. No more endless back and forth between buyers and sellers - we take care of everything so you don\u2019t have to.  \r\n\r\nFair Market Value data - make informed buying decisions with our fair market value range, sales history, and indicators that show you if a book is a good deal.\r\n\r\nPortfolio Manager - manage your For Sale inventory and your Personal Collection all in one place with the Portfolio Manager. Organize your collection and track the value of your Portfolio for free.\r\n\r\nPrice Guide - look up recent sales history with our free price guide featuring over one million recent comic book sales across multiple platforms. Did we mention it\u2019s free?\r\n\r\nAmazing content - check the app often for new content from the community, how-to guides, collector spotlights, free giveaways, newsletters, and more!\r\n\r\nReady to buy and sell?  \r\n\r\nPlease read the FAQ in-app or on Shortboxed.com for a complete list of all the buying and selling policies.\r\n\r\nDownload Shortboxed today and connect with our community on Instagram, Facebook and Twitter @shortboxed and on TikTok @shortboxedcomics.",
    "descriptionHTML": "What is Shortboxed?<br><br>Shortboxed is the most trusted marketplace and auction platform to buy and sell comic books. In addition to a thriving community with tens of thousands of buyers and sellers, there are also free tools and resources such as a price guide, portfolio manager, extensive data, and quality content to make buying and selling easy, safe, and fun.<br><br>How does buying and selling work?<br><br>For the marketplace, vetted dealers, comic shop owners, and collectors list their comic books for sale on Shortboxed while buyers browse and discover tens of thousands of comic books, both graded and ungraded. When someone buys a book, the seller receives an order confirmation with a pre-paid shipping label. Sellers get paid once the book is confirmed delivered. Our seller fee is a flat 10% - no hidden fees or shenanigans. Super simple!<br><br>For event style auctions, approved sellers send in their books to Shortboxed before an auction is curated. Once the auction event is live, buyers can bid on items until the closing time. Once an auction event ends, winners will receive an invoice to pay before receiving their items.<br><br>Shortboxed Features<br><br>Sell raw or graded comic books - you can submit raw or graded comic books for sale on Shortboxed, with all raw books verified by Shortboxed before being delivered to the buyer. Buy and sell with confidence!<br><br>Quick and easy submissions - take a couple pics, add a price and any additional info as needed, and that\u2019s it. We take care of the rest, including exposure to tens of thousands of potential buyers across the U.S., Canada and U.K.  <br><br>We handle customer support - have an issue with an order? Our attentive team will take care of any questions or order issues. No more endless back and forth between buyers and sellers - we take care of everything so you don\u2019t have to.  <br><br>Fair Market Value data - make informed buying decisions with our fair market value range, sales history, and indicators that show you if a book is a good deal.<br><br>Portfolio Manager - manage your For Sale inventory and your Personal Collection all in one place with the Portfolio Manager. Organize your collection and track the value of your Portfolio for free.<br><br>Price Guide - look up recent sales history with our free price guide featuring over one million recent comic book sales across multiple platforms. Did we mention it\u2019s free?<br><br>Amazing content - check the app often for new content from the community, how-to guides, collector spotlights, free giveaways, newsletters, and more!<br><br>Ready to buy and sell?  <br><br>Please read the FAQ in-app or on Shortboxed.com for a complete list of all the buying and selling policies.<br><br>Download Shortboxed today and connect with our community on Instagram, Facebook and Twitter @shortboxed and on TikTok @shortboxedcomics.",
